{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47785","headline":"嫁女诗 八 · 嵩岳诸仙","name":"嫁女诗 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽蓟烟尘别九重，贵妃汤殿罢歌钟。\n中宵扈从无全杖，大驾苍黄发六龙。\n妆匣尚留金翡翠，暖池犹浸玉芙蓉。\n荆榛一闭朝元路，唯有悲风吹晚松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"嵩岳诸仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}